  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_QUICK_SHOT_CANNON
    value: <style=title><size=42>QUICK SHOT CANNON</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_QUICK_SHOT_CANNON
    value: '<size=24>- The Flying Pig on-screen pay is triggered randomly during reel
      spin.

      - Win the multiplier the Flying Pig lands on.

      - Multiply line wins and Scatter wins by up to 10x!'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_STICKY_LANDING_BONUS
    value: <style=title><size=42>STICKY LANDING BONUS</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_STICKY_LANDING_BONUS
    value: "<size=24>- Sticky Landing Bonus is triggered randomly during reel spin.
      \n- All Wilds become Sticky Landing Wilds and remain sticky for 3 FREE spins!\n-
      Bonus ends when no new Wilds appear and all free spins have been used."
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_FREE_GAMES
    value: <style=title><size=42>FREE GAMES</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_FREE_GAMES
    value: "<size=24>- 3 Big Top Bonus symbols on reels 1, 3, and 5 triggers 10 Free
      Games.\n- Expanding Sticky Landing Wilds may also be randomly triggered and
      remain \n  sticky for 3 FREE spins. \n- Quick Shot Cannon may also be randomly
      triggered during free games.  "
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_SECOND_CHANCE
    value: <style=title><size=42>SECOND CHANCE RE-SPIN</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_SECOND_CHANCE
    value: "<size=24>- If 2 Big Top Bonus symbols land on reels 1 and 3, and not on
      reel 5, 5th reel\n  MAY randomly  re-spin for one more Bonus symbol."
  - key: PAYTABLE_WAY_INFO
    value: <size=24><color=#00eaff>50 LINES</color></size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_BET_INFO
    value: '<size=24><color=#00eaff>Bet Per Line: 1</color></size>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_LINES
    value: <style=title><size=42>LINES</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_JACKPOTS
    value: <style=title><size=42>GRAND & MEGA JACKPOTS</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_JACKPOTS
    value: '<size=24>- Each spin provides the user an opportunity to win the Jackpot.

      - After each spin, either a GRAND or MEGA JACKPOT may be awarded.'
  - key: BUTTON_FREE_SPIN_START
    value: START
  - key: CONTENTS_GAME_TITLE
    value: Big Top Dogs
